---
layout: layouts/base.njk
current: blog
title: Blog
permalink: /blog/
description: "Articles from Program Partner on running a band, orchestra, choir, theatre or studio program: fees, forms, families and the work around them."
---
{#- The blog's index: every article published in HeyCatch, as that build read them (src/_data/blog.js; README: "Blog").
    Title, published date and read time only: no excerpt and no images. -#}
<div style="padding:clamp(56px,8vw,104px) 0 var(--section-y)">
<div class="wrap-narrow stack" style="gap:28px">
<h1 style="font-size:clamp(40px,5.4vw,64px);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.02em">Blog</h1>
{%- if blog.articles.length %}
<ol class="changelog blog-list">
{%- for a in blog.articles %}
<li>
<h2><a href="{{ a.path }}">{{ a.title }}</a></h2>
{%- if a.publishedLabel or a.readTime %}
<p class="when">{% if a.publishedLabel %}<time datetime="{{ a.published }}">{{ a.publishedLabel }}</time>{% endif %}{% if a.publishedLabel and a.readTime %}<span aria-hidden="true"> · </span>{% endif %}{% if a.readTime %}{{ a.readTime }} min read{% endif %}</p>
{%- endif %}
</li>
{%- endfor %}
</ol>
{%- else %}
<p class="lede">No articles yet.</p>
{%- endif %}
</div>
</div>
